<title>ITALY: Gross yield set at 7.09 pct at 10-yr BTP sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield set at 7.09 pct at 10-yr BTP sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 6.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   February 1, 2007   previous</p>
<p> Net Yield	 6.20 pct vs	6.20 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     7.09 pct vs	7.17 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price   98.40   vs    104.85</p>
<p> Bids		 3.789 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The yields and price are not directly comparable as the last 10-year Btp auction on January 15 was of an 11th tranche of a November 1, 2006 Btp carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
